I put cement into the workbench.

3012
02:47:33,391 --> 02:47:34,811
ありがとう。足りなかった。
Thank you. It wasn't enough.

3013
02:47:36,431 --> 02:47:37,371
あと金属だな。
And metal, huh.

3014
